WEBVTT

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:11.871
Choose Captions in the side menu.

00:00:15.231 --> 00:00:21.231
Check the State of your video.

00:00:24.188 --> 00:00:30.188
Click Failed 1 above the list.

00:00:33.145 --> 00:00:39.145
Click Retry captions for
Fractions with Jollof Rice.

00:00:45.049 --> 00:00:51.049
Check that Captions could not
be made for this video appears.

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:04.158
Click Try again.

00:01:05.759 --> 00:01:11.759
Wait until Making captions appears.
